{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1721607001:1":{"text":"エリエルのお友だちになってあげてくださいね。","source_cn":"你们几个可以陪艾尔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x498BB7F47F6E6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721607002:0":{"text":"なあ、ホーレン。ここって守備軍の駐屯地だよな？","source_cn":"呼伦，这还是守备军驻地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE7288202440BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721607003:0":{"text":"ははっ、まるで貴族のご令嬢の寝室みたいだな！","source_cn":"我还以为是哪个贵族小姐的卧室！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF982B19FE203FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721607004:1":{"text":"おいおい、その言い方はないだろ……みたい、じゃなくて、本物の貴族のお嬢様なんだからよ！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！呼伦，你别这么说。毕竟人家可是正牌的贵族小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE395A567A69663DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721607005:1":{"text":"まあ、弓ばかりいじってるのもしんどいよな。たまには童心に返って癒やされたいんだろうよ。","source_cn":"摆弄弓箭的日子太苦了，肯定得玩点童趣的东西找找安慰嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE88DFF7D3C4497C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721607006:1":{"text":"癒やしねえ。そんなふにゃふにゃしたもので喜ぶのは、三歳児くらいじゃねえの？","source_cn":"安慰玩偶嘛？这种软趴趴的东西，三岁小孩才玩吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B15E3565B1D76EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721607007:1":{"text":"休憩時間に、私が私物で何をしようと、あなたたちには関係ないでしょう。","source_cn":"现在是自由活动时间。我的私人物品与你们无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E219859AF761DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721607008:1":{"text":"そんなに暇なら、荷重トレーニングをもう二セット追加しますか？","source_cn":"如果太闲，我不介意让你们加两组负重跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F31B5BBAB00CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721607009:2":{"text":"そんなに怖い顔しないでくださいよ、グウィネス隊長。俺たちはただ、守備軍の駐屯地にそれは場違いだと思っただけで。","source_cn":"别这么严肃嘛，格温妮丝队长。我们只是觉得……这东西和守...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F704B0741C0ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721607010:1":{"text":"守備軍の兵士がぬいぐるみなんかで遊んでるところを王都の民衆にでも見られたら、軍全体のイメージダウンに繋がりますよ。","source_cn":"毕竟您是守备军，是战士。真正的军人，应该像我们一样强壮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78C75C57D3C4C58D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721607011:1":{"text":"隊長たる者、もっと守備軍らしく振る舞ってもらわないと困ります……ね？","source_cn":"你这样子，可没有一点守备军的模样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0230132F0070471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721607012:1":{"text":"なるほど、あなたたちのように偏見にまみれ、自分の無能を粗野な振る舞いで隠すのが、守備軍らしいというわけですか。","source_cn":"守备军的模样？你是说，像你们这样满嘴偏见、只会用粗鲁来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E95E212DB6A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721607013:2":{"text":"てめぇ……！誰が無能だって！？隊長だからって、俺たちが黙ってると思うなよ！","source_cn":"你——！说谁无能？！别以为你是队长我们就怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FA608C19D58570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721607014:1":{"text":"はんっ、お父様におんぶに抱っこで、その地位に収まっただけのくせに。俺たちに説教するつもりか？","source_cn":"你不就是靠着你父亲才坐上这个位置的吗？还敢教训我们什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DF520B71C89AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721607015:1":{"text":"なんなら、今ここで白黒つけてもいいんですよ？それとも、大事なぬいぐるみが汚れるのが心配ですか？","source_cn":"既然队长这么自信，不如让我们见识一下？还是说，您怕弄坏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE50C2AB865FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721607016:1":{"text":"いいでしょう。どうやら守備軍というものを誤解しているようなので、私が特別に教えてあげます。まとめてかかってきなさい。","source_cn":"很好。既然你们对守备军这个词有这么大的误解，那我就免费...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B25351A41EBB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721607017:1":{"text":"そっちから言い出したんだからな！多勢に無勢でも文句言うなよ！","source_cn":"这可是你自找的！别怪我们以多欺少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F729AD92210590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军盖伊":{"text":"守備軍のギイ","source":"守备军盖伊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军呼伦":{"text":"守備軍のホーレン","source":"守备军呼伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}